  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.6.0 expands Web API support and version compatibility.\n\n- Adds the official Torrent Creator API and missing Application, Torrent, and Search operations.\n- Adds CancellationToken support across public asynchronous network operations.\n- Improves endpoint, rename, torrent-filter, and Add Torrent compatibility across qBittorrent versions.\n- Expands isolated contract, networking, serialization, and compatibility tests.",
